OL,3,GNEWSAHeathrow expansion an 'outdated'
OL,4,Arisk, mayor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe London mayor has formally opposed
OL,7,Fplans for a third runway at Heathrow
OL,8,FAirport, arguing the expansion
OL,9,Fthreatens environmental targets and
OL,10,Ftransport networks.
OL,12,FCity Hall and Transport for London
OL,13,F(TfL) submitted a joint response to the
OL,14,Fgovernment's draft Heathrow Expansion
OL,15,FNational Policy Statement (HENPS)
OL,16,Fconsultation.
OL,18,FSir Sadiq Khan claimed the strategic
OL,19,Fcase relied on outdated evidence that
OL,20,F"fails to reflect current climate laws
OL,21,Fand travel habits".
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
